# Project Rules (loaded by coding agents)

These are mandatory project rules for any agent working in this repository.

## Commands
- Run backend tests: `npm test` (from repo root or `backend/`)
- Run backend lint: `npm run lint`
- Run e2e tests: `npx playwright test` (from repo root)
- Start backend in dev: `npm run dev`
- Re-seed demo data: `npm run seed`

## Conventions
- Do NOT add code comments unless the task asks for them.
- Follow existing file naming: `camelCase` for JS modules, `kebab-case` for pages/static assets.
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones.
- Keep AI logic inside `backend/src/services/agent/`.
- All AI decisions MUST write an audit log entry.
- All API responses use JSON with a consistent `{ success, data }` envelope.
- Never commit `.env` files or secrets.

## Quality gates
- `npm test` must pass before finishing a task.
- `npm run lint` must pass.
- CI pipeline (GitHub Actions) must stay green.
